    {
      "bbox": [
        196,
        756,
        1785,
        1277
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Your Honor has directed that a Career and Salary Plan be established for civil service employees and that immediate action be taken to develop the job classification and establish the rates of pay which will serve to implement it. The elements of the plan, specified in your communication of October 10, 1952 to the President of the Civil Service Commission, were:",
